  "id": "certification",
  "term": "certification",
  "definition": "In this school-development context, certification means the formal diagnostic labeling of a student’s difficulties as special educational needs. It is described as a process shaped by how teachers, parents, and health services interpret nonconformity with school expectations, often using the label to manage uncertainty or shift responsibility to specialists.",
